firoozbakht — a full-lane cosmon-fleet attack on Firoozbakht's conjecture
Copyright (c) 2026 Noogram

This repository records an agent-fleet attack on an open mathematical conjecture,
produced by germinating a cosmon "spore", and bundles the spore that was run.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
cosmon
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The spore format, the `cs spore` tooling, and the formulas bundled under
`spores/math-attack/formulas/` originate in cosmon.
  https://github.com/noogram/cosmon

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
math-attack spore
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The bundled spore under `spores/math-attack/` is a copy of the published spore:
  https://github.com/noogram/sporarium  (spores/math-attack)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Lean / Mathlib
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The full lane's Lean firewall builds against Mathlib (Apache-2.0,
Copyright (c) The Mathlib Community, https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4).
Lean artifacts and their pinned toolchain are added under the run directory as the
Lean nodes complete.
